{"synopsis":"Pemusnahan umat manusia yang tidak berharga akan dimulai\nBattle Net yang dianggap sebagai suatu game telah menjadi bencana bagi umat manusia Setelah dilangsungkannya Space League Dimana makhluk dari seluruh alam semesta bersaing untuk hidup mereka masingmasing Perwakilan dari Bumi telah mengalami kekalahan yang berulang Kecuali satu orang dia adalah sang Martial Saint Seong JiHan\nDengan skillnya Nameless Divine Arts menolak penghapusan sistem yang ada Manusia yang sudah dianggap sebagai spesies yang tidak berharga mendapatkan Kesempatan lain Kesempatan itu diberikan kepada Seong JiHan\nKali ini pasti akan berbeda\nKarena dia kembali ke awal setelah melihat akhir dari game itu","alternative_title":"2레벨로 회귀한 무신","author":"Ah Yoongu","artist":"Lee Yoon-Gu","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"da8503df-e575-4a58-b02f-bca6260c5ef3","number":"126","chapter":"126","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"686e71d1-5213-4a23-87ac-262c736a47eb","number":"125","chapter":"125","title":"","date":"2026-07-20","released":"2026-07-20"},{"chapter_id":"c0dd01d3-f74e-470d-9c62-54fc3745996d","number":"124","chapter":"124","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"5b756a0c-3ff2-440a-8066-1e77dacccc65","number":"123","chapter":"123","title":"","date":"2026-07-06","released":"2026-07-06"},{"chapter_id":"bf82a163-dc29-40ba-94c9-277a8a38fdce","number":"122","chapter":"122","title":"","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29"},{"chapter_id":"c118e7da-49fb-49a8-9d1f-cac97da5910c","number":"121","chapter":"121","title":"","date":"2026-06-22","released":"2026-06-22"},{"chapter_id":"a681900c-ca11-453a-90af-9b969a9441ae","number":"120","chapter":"120","title":"","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15"},{"chapter_id":"cc618cc9-0b65-47cb-adca-18014832d0ee","number":"119","chapter":"119","title":"","date":"2026-06-01","released":"2026-06-01"},{"chapter_id":"ea2bb577-6ec7-4408-b47b-36d33bbea9f7","number":"118","chapter":"118","titl